  "definition": "Same-budget full set on official rgb_test dishes that have an overhead rgb.png. Each method commits one energy and one mass. The decision step is the first predicted STOP or ABSTAIN, or the last step if the method never predicts a terminal action. Committed nutrition is the latest finite nutri_dish at or before that step. Later totals are not credited. A dish missing energy or mass is unscored and is not imputed as zero. The paired table keeps only dishes scored by every method. Cafe labels score the error and do not choose actions, codes, grams, or thresholds. Tool cost counts RETRIEVE, CORRECT_CODE, RE_PORTION, and RE_DECOMPOSE through the decision step. STOP and ABSTAIN are not tools. The step cap is K=32. Coverage and AURC are auxiliary. This is not the hold-out action-agreement table and not a reinforcement-learning run.",
